think at that time I hadn't learned the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:12.560
importance of titles. Titles have to&nbsp;
be strong and understandable and have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:18.080
