and everything I wrote had&nbsp;
some weird thing that I learned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:31.760
but that was by far the weirdest title I&nbsp;
think I came up with which was Audacious.

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:33.360
