00:01:43.422 --> 00:01:46.320
Joston: Yeah and that's really what it was about,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:51.600
this vampire needing this guy to&nbsp;
come to fruition to come to be.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:55.560
