into the craft it was still very much just how do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:35.840
I make this look professional so how long did it&nbsp;
take you to finish that screenplay oh five days&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:44.080
oh wow okay five days in the beginning I wrote&nbsp;
screenplays in a week or less in a week because&nbsp;&nbsp;

